:question
$()	   On considère la fonction 
!insmath f
$() définie sur 
!insmath \lbrack -10^3;10^3 \rbrack
$() par	<div class="wimscenter"> 
!insmath f(x)=$val26
$() </div>	<p>	   On note 
!insmath f(-10^3)=L_1
$() et 
!insmath f(10^3)=L_2
$() avec $val28.</p>		   On veut déterminer <b>sans calculatrice </b> le nombre de solutions de l'équation	<div class="wimscenter"> 
!insmath f(x)=0
$()</div>	<ol>		<li> Compléter le tableau des variations de 
!insmath f
$()&nbsp;:	<table class="var_tab">	<tr>	  <th style="width:12%;"> 
!insmath x
$()</th>	      <td style="width:12%;">
!insmath -10^3
$()</td>	      <td style="width:12%;"></td>	      <td style="width:12%;"> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply1,3 
$()</td>	      <td style="width:12%;"></td>	      <td style="width:12%;"> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply2,3 
$()</td>	      <td style="width:12%;"></td>	      <td style="width:12%;text-align:right">
!insmath +10^3
$()</td>	</tr><tr>	  <th style="width:12%;"> sg 
!insmath f'(x)
$()</th>	      <td style="width:12%;text-align:left"> &nbsp;</td>	      <td style="width:12%;"> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply3,$val9 
$()</td>	      <td style="width:12%;">0</td>	      <td style="width:12%;"> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply4,$val9 
$()</td>	      <td style="width:12%;">0</td>	      <td style="width:12%;"> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply5,$val9 
$()</td>	      <td style="width:12%;">&nbsp;</td>	</tr><tr>	  <th style="width:12%;">
!insmath var f
$()</th>	     <td style="width:12%;text-align:left" > 
!insmath L_1
$()</td>	     <td style="width:12%;vertical-align:middle">  
!read oef/embed.phtml reply6,$val9 
$() </td>	     <td style="width:12%;vertical-align:middle">  
!read oef/embed.phtml reply7,$val10 
$() </td>	     <td style="width:12%;vertical-align:middle">  
!read oef/embed.phtml reply8,$val9 
$() </td>	     <td style="width:12%;vertical-align:middle">  
!read oef/embed.phtml reply9,$val10 
$() </td>	     <td style="width:12%;vertical-align:middle">  
!read oef/embed.phtml reply10,$val9 
$() </td>	     <td style="width:12%;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle"> 
!insmath L_2
$() </td>	      </tr>	</table>	</li>		<li> En déduire le nombre de solutions de 
!insmath f(x)=0
$()&nbsp;:	<div class="wimscenter"> Nombre de solutions =  
!read oef/embed.phtml reply11,2 
$() </div></li>		</ol>	
